# E31 treatment arm: mixed prefill+decode batching ON.
# Paired back-to-back with configs/mixedbatch_off.env on the SAME box/GPU.
# Only difference between the two files is --enable-mixed-batch.
#
# DOES NOT RUN ON sm_120 TODAY -- kept so the arm is one command away once the
# backend supports it. No MHA-arch attention backend we can run here can serve a
# ForwardMode.MIXED batch: mha/fa3/fa4/triton/flashinfer are all one
# MHAAttnBackend, which rejects MIXED, and the one that accepts it (trtllm) is
# TRT-LLM-gen FMHA, sm_100/103 only. The engine now refuses this config at
# startup instead of dying on the first mixed step. See E31 in
# docs/experiments-log.md.
MODEL=/workspace/models/Qwen/Qwen3-8B
GPU=3
PORT=8030
ATTN=triton
# E17: the 139GB host-KVStore allocation OOM-kills the server on this box.
EXTRA_ARGS="--disable-kvstore --enable-mixed-batch"
PROFILE=0
BASELINE=clean
